WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:27.226
The buddies walked on the beach.

2
00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:33.122
Sid lay in the sand.

3
00:00:33.123 --> 00:00:39.726
"It's nice here." He yawned.

4
00:00:39.727 --> 00:00:43.362
"I'm tired."

5
00:00:43.363 --> 00:00:45.752
Tor sat down.

6
00:00:45.753 --> 00:00:48.666
"I don't want to get wet," she said.

7
00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:54.926
"I just like the sun."

8
00:00:54.927 --> 00:00:59.092
Rex went near the water.

9
00:00:59.093 --> 00:01:01.173
He dipped his toe in.

10
00:01:01.174 --> 00:01:06.252
"Brr!" Rex said.

11
00:01:06.253 --> 00:01:10.732
Sara walked into the water.

12
00:01:10.733 --> 00:01:13.256
"Come on, Rex," she said.

13
00:01:13.257 --> 00:01:21.363
"Come in!"

14
00:01:21.364 --> 00:01:23.946
Suddenly a wave rose.

15
00:01:23.947 --> 00:01:26.861
It knocked over Rex and Sara.

16
00:01:26.862 --> 00:01:30.988
Splash! They fell in the water.

17
00:01:30.989 --> 00:01:37.872
Rex and Sara laughed.

18
00:01:37.873 --> 00:01:44.726
The two buddies splashed.

19
00:01:44.727 --> 00:01:47.063
"Fun!" Sara said.

20
00:01:47.064 --> 00:01:52.698
"Yeah!" Rex said.

21
00:01:52.699 --> 00:01:55.493
Rex jumped into the water.

22
00:01:55.494 --> 00:01:58.776
Sara made waves.

23
00:01:58.777 --> 00:02:02.051
The water rose again.

24
00:02:02.052 --> 00:02:07.382
But this wasn't a wave . . .

25
00:02:07.383 --> 00:02:10.556
It was a really big dinosaur!

26
00:02:10.557 --> 00:02:13.142
Rex and Sara screamed.

27
00:02:13.143 --> 00:02:16.757
"Ahh!"

